      "raw_duration": 13.6998,
      "raw_file": "D:\\@kaifa\\PeiYin\\出稿\\008_黄帝\\narration-chunks\\032-714ed88357.wav"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "我是艾伦，遛狗去了，白了个白。",
